Brew and static-build samples (*-brew.txt, ffmpeg-git-static.txt) are hand-written in
the exact format those builds print. *-ubuntu.txt are recorded from WSL Ubuntu 24.04,
except heif-dec-1.17-ubuntu.txt, written by hand until libheif-examples is installed:
record it with `heif-dec --version > heif-dec-1.17-ubuntu.txt` and adjust the parser
if the test then fails.
